GPT-QModel original MiniCPM port

This product contains code adapted from OpenBMB MiniCPM, under Apache-2.0.
Copyright 2022 EleutherAI and the HuggingFace Inc. team. All rights reserved.
OpenBMB adapted the GPT-NeoX/OPT/Meta implementation for MiniCPM; the
configuration also credits EleutherAI and Hugging Face. Original rotary
scaling credits kaiokendev (linear), bloc97 and emozilla (dynamic NTK).
ModelCloud.ai adapted the inspected implementation for Transformers 5 in 2026.

Source repositories, immutable revisions and SHA-256 digests are recorded in
source_manifest.json. LICENSE preserves OpenBMB's Apache-2.0 license text.
The model cards separately require the OpenBMB General Model License for
trained weights. No trained weights or tokenizer assets are redistributed here.

Changes include Transformers 5 model/config/cache/generation integration,
definition-owned loading, stateless FP32 rotary construction, portable
eager/SDPA attention and expert dispatch, safetensors lifecycle tests, live
module ownership and a conservative plain-quantization-only AWQ policy.
